# Browser-test screenshots (UX once-over). Skill writes them under
# ~/Documents/playwright-mcp-output/ now — these patterns are belt-and-braces
# in case an agent forgets the path prefix and a screenshot lands at the repo
# root. The proper fix lives in ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md.
event-detail.png
test_workshop.html
verif-*.png
uxr-*.png
*-pr*.png
step*.png
step*.jpg
step*.jpeg
mcp-*.png
mcp-*.jpg
mcp-*.jpeg
screenshot-*.png
screenshot-*.jpg
screenshot-*.jpeg
page-2[0-9][0-9][0-9]-*.yml
console-2[0-9][0-9][0-9]-*.log
playwright-trace-*.zip

# Same class, one level down: the patterns above are filename-anchored, so a
# whole folder of verification shots (e.g. footer-verify/) slipped past them.
*-verify/
